{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2022-06-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF CERNER', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS , JUNE 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE CORPORATION (NYSE: ORCL) ANNOUNCED THAT A MAJORITY OF THE OUTSTANDING SHARES (THE "SHARES") OF CERNER CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CERN) WERE VALIDLY TENDERED, AND THE OTHER CONDITIONS TO THE TENDER OFFER HAVE BEEN SATISFIED OR WAIVED.\xa0 THE DEAL WILL CLOSE\xa0ON JUNE 8, 2022.'}